+
+A valid answer is:
+
+```text
+<answer>[[16,1,17],[32,31,43],[4,24,56],[40,26,3],[8,53,9],[48,10,21],[6,19,54],[45,46,44],[47,25,12],[38,2,34],[35,30,15],[52,39,14],[27,50,49],[37,51,11],[41,23,29],[5,42,22],[33,55,57],[7,13,28],[18,20,36]]</answer>
